,"source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"ダリオスサウム","creatorId":"vndb:s27568","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s27568","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s27568","name":"鈴木 規夫","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:214213","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"飴乃 あめ","creatorId":"vndb:s37395","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s37395","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s37395","name":"飴乃 あめ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:214214","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c150583","characterName":"椎名 雪","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"172867","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"540226"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27593"],"vndbCharacterId":"c150583"},"originalCharacterName":"椎名 雪","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"21"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"No way I was getting you to bed, so I just dumped you on the sofa — no hard feelings, okay?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the protagonist's roommate, his friend since high school, and his ex-girlfriend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"They started dating more out of comfort than romantic feelings—simply because being together felt easy. Eventually, they drifted apart just as casually, realizing little would change whether they dated or not."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite this past relationship, they remain on excellent terms—far from hostile, even exceptionally close. They share moments of near-telepathic understanding, existing in that ambiguous space of \"more than friends, less than family.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a decisive personality to the extent of even startling men, and never hesitates to reject what she dislikes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c150583"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のルームシェア相手であり、高校時代からの友人で元彼女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好意というより、一緒にいて気が楽だからと付き合い始めたものの、別に付き合ってなくてもあんまかわらないなと、なんとなくで付き合って、なんとなくで別れた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな元恋人の関係ではあるものの、お互い仲が悪いわけではなく、むしろかなり良好で、時々以心伝心レベルで息が合う、友達以上家族未満みたいな関係性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男もびっくりするくらいきっぱりしている性格で、嫌なことは迷いなく嫌といえてしまうタイプ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27593","sourceWorkId":"38067","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ベッドまで連れて行くのは無理そうだったから、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ソファに寝かせたけど、そこは恨みっこなしで」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のルームシェア相手であり、高校時代からの友人で元彼女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好意というより、一緒にいて気が楽だからと付き合い始めたものの、別に付き合ってなくてもあんまかわらないなと、なんとなくで付き合って、なんとなくで別れた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな元恋人の関係ではあるものの、お互い仲が悪いわけではなく、むしろかなり良好で、時々以心伝心レベルで息が合う、友達以上家族未満みたいな関係性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男もびっくりするくらいきっぱりしている性格で、嫌なことは迷いなく嫌といえてしまうタイプ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"172867"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/07850880d6fc70ebe0a5eff8703fc9cd13ccee85b427e7cdd84974a83fc6fa8d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/9023e9651b248a6a772f7cccbe5bfe56da20f1ff855d30a5a58bc0f31b3ba0ed.webp","width":115,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤田茜","creatorId":"vndb:s8737","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8737","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8737","name":"藤田 茜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:540226:172867:17981:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c150584","characterName":"水瓶 陽向","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"172868","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"540226"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27594"],"vndbCharacterId":"c150584"},"originalCharacterName":"水瓶 陽向","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Heeey, Yamabuki-senpaaai~! Let’s drink together, pleaaase?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Protagonist's kouhai who declared herself an Ultra Super Beauty upon her \"university debut\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a stylish university girl just like her fellows, and is easy to get along well with anyone—especially radiating the kind of vibe that makes older adults dote on her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While polite and reserved with strangers, she drops all pretenses around close friends: leveraging her self-aware cuteness as a tool to pester them (often annoyingly). Yet she instantly blushes if someone flips the script by sincerely praising her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c150584"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大学デビューでウルトラスーパー美少女（自称）になった後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人並みにおしゃれが好きな美少女大学生で、誰とでも仲良くなれる人懐っこい性格をしており、主に高齢者に可愛がられやすい雰囲気を出している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"初対面の人には礼儀正しく、控えめな感じだが、特別親しい相手には遠慮しない性格で、自分の可愛さを自覚しているからこそ、それを持ちネタにしつつ、ウザ絡みしてきたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、それを逆手にとって褒めると照れる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27594","sourceWorkId":"38067","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ねぇ〜、山吹せんぱぁ〜い、一緒に飲みましょうよ〜」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大学デビューでウルトラスーパー美少女（自称）になった後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人並みにおしゃれが好きな美少女大学生で、誰とでも仲良くなれる人懐っこい性格をしており、主に高齢者に可愛がられやすい雰囲気を出している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"初対面の人には礼儀正しく、控えめな感じだが、特別親しい相手には遠慮しない性格で、自分の可愛さを自覚しているからこそ、それを持ちネタにしつつ、ウザ絡みしてきたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、それを逆手にとって褒めると照れる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"172868"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9bf4b0167086c62ea4a93e72f8a2659dd44c4d3881f49e754d725e786d06e7a8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/908b2ebeedb6ec054350c4c868e26c64bdad9228f19e771d64f060595a5b17a3.webp","width":112,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藍沢夏癒","creatorId":"vndb:s3233","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3233","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3233","name":"藍沢 夏癒","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:540226:172868:35182:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c150585","characterName":"花咲 小春","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"172869","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"540226"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27595"],"vndbCharacterId":"c150585"},"originalCharacterName":"花咲 小春","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"27"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Minato-kun, what's your part-time job restaurant like?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A bright, cheerful older-sister figure who's blithely carefree—for better or worse."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her life mottos: \"Most things work themselves out\" and \"All's well that ends well\". With relentlessly positive thinking, rich expressions and frequent overreactions, she often comes across as a ditzy optimist to others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But beneath that sunny exterior lies unexpected reliability: She is able to thoroughly judge things with pragmatic thinking—proven by her success as a freelance graphic designer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c150585"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"良くも悪くもお気楽な性格をしている明朗快活なお姉さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「大抵のことはなんとかなる」と「終わりよければすべてよし」が信条で、非常にポジティブな考え方をしていたり、表情豊かでよくオーバリアクションをするので、周りからは能天気に見られることが多々ある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただそんな性格とは裏腹に、物事をしっかりと見定めることのできる思慮深さを持っており、フリーランスのグラフィックデザイナーとして活躍していたりと意外としっかりしている人。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27595","sourceWorkId":"38067","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「湊人くんのバイト先って、どんなお店なの？」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"良くも悪くもお気楽な性格をしている明朗快活なお姉さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「大抵のことはなんとかなる」と「終わりよければすべてよし」が信条で、非常にポジティブな考え方をしていたり、表情豊かでよくオーバリアクションをするので、周りからは能天気に見られることが多々ある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただそんな性格とは裏腹に、物事をしっかりと見定めることのできる思慮深さを持っており、フリーランスのグラフィックデザイナーとして活躍していたりと意外としっかりしている人。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"172869"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e28062833aa1be531954d3618f2ac16d5c7259e280a468ef5664f9f39cdcd237.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bd8e0aa669d25d0617b311cab49beb698bacac2e5176aedd2cddba2fb9d84c00.webp","width":114,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"空賀花","creatorId":"vndb:s15476","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15476","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15476","name":"空賀 花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:540226:172869:34089:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c150586","characterName":"和泉 秋奈","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"172870","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"540226"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27596"],"vndbCharacterId":"c150586"},"originalCharacterName":"和泉 秋奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"28"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"166"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"—I must say, your recommended dish was exquisite. Thank you.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A fiercely accomplished career woman with a stellar track record. Despite her flawless specs—brilliant at her job, well-paid, and strikingly beautiful—she is trapped in an endless \"man drought\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"To be fair, she could easily date high-caliber men if not too fastidious. But her high ideals—or to say nitpicking quirks and pursuit of \"chemistry\"—keep her from dating anyone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Now nearing marriageable age, she flirts with despair, consoling herself with work as she armor-plates her loneliness."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c150586"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事では数々の成功を収める現役バリバリやり手のキャリアウーマン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事ができて、収入がそこそこあって、おまけに美人という隙のないスペックのくせに年がら年中男日照りしてる人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"といっても本人のスペック的に選り好みさえしなければ、かなりいい男性とお付き合いできるくらいではあるのだが、理想が高い、というより変な拘りとなんかピンと来ないという理由で誰とも付き合わない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結果的に結婚適齢期まじかになって自暴自棄になりかけ中で、仕事が恋人を逃げ道に孤独を決め込もうとしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27596","sourceWorkId":"38067","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「——おすすめの一品、とてもおいしかったわ。ありがとう」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事では数々の成功を収める現役バリバリやり手のキャリアウーマン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事ができて、収入がそこそこあって、おまけに美人という隙のないスペックのくせに年がら年中男日照りしてる人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"といっても本人のスペック的に